Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你看一眼，跟我说她和她姊姊 长得不像{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Now tell me she doesn't look exactly like her sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我觉得不一样啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm saying I see a difference.{\r}
