Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不要再做了如何{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let's not do that anymore. - Okay.{\r}
