Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你姊姊乌苏拉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Your sister, Ursula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 真的吗？ - 真的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Oh, really? - Yeah.{\r}
