Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道  她说你们好几年 不讲话了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, you do? She said you guys haven't talked in years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hmm? Yeah.{\r}
