Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}从我角度来看是没有{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Not from where I was standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你是什么角度{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Where were you standing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}菲比，你们两个处不来吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, Pheebs, so you guys just don't get along?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就一些姊妹间的小事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's mostly just dumb sister stuff, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}大家都说她比较漂亮{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Everyone always thought of her as the pretty one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她也先学会走路{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh. Oh. She was the first to walk...{\r}
