Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但在我父母眼中 就不稀罕了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}To my parents, by then it was, "Yeah, what else is new?"{\r}
