Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只有你和卡萝会去吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So is this just gonna be you and Carol?{\r}
